    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAUCHO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is an action adventure, where combat demands your concentration to the maximum in order to survive the attacks of colossal enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploring subway stations in an apocalyptic Buenos Aires, defeat the Demon Bosses one by one to escape to the surface and save your kitten.<br><br><strong>Boss Fights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles with powerful enemies, where you'll need to learn from them by fighting over and over until you manage to defeat them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Station Exploration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Node-based levels. Each step forward opens and closes paths. Explore and re-explore the stations to discover all their routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the boss fights at each station, face other minions inside the stations, practice and improve with them. Gain experience and level up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decision Events</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring, you'll have to make decisions; Help a stranger, walk into an obvious trap to reach a new item, convince someone to ally with you. You'll need to choose wisely...</p>",
